{
  "dom_id": "step-14283",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Solving a Quadratic Equation With Purely Imaginary Solutions With Simplification",
  "problem": "If $p^2 + 27 = 0,$ then $p =$",
  "worked_solution": "First, we rearrange the equation, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\np^2 + 27 & = 0\\[3pt]\n\np^2 & = -27 \n}\n$$\n\nBy taking the square root, we obtain\n\n$$\np = \\pm \\sqrt{-27}.\n$$\n\nWe now rewrite $p$ using the imaginary unit $\\textrm{i}=\\sqrt{-1}\\, \\mathbin{:}$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}p & =\\pm \\sqrt{-27} \\\\  & =\\pm \\sqrt{27\\cdot (-1)} \\\\  & =\\pm \\sqrt{27}\\cdot \\sqrt{-1} \\\\  & =\\pm \\sqrt{{3}^{2}\\cdot 3}\\cdot \\sqrt{-1} \\\\  & =\\pm 3\\sqrt{3}\\cdot \\sqrt{-1} \\\\  & =\\pm 3\\sqrt{3}\\,\\text{i}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solutions are $p = \\pm 3\\sqrt{3} \\, \\textrm{i}.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-14283\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"14283\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"4028\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-14283\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-5\">Solving a Quadratic Equation With Purely Imaginary Solutions With Simplification</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"14283\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                          